# GitHub Linguist overrides.
#
# Both files below are build outputs committed for static serving, not authored
# source. Without these rules their combined ~6.7 MB outweighs the ~2.4 MB of
# TypeScript and GitHub classifies the repository as HTML.
#
# linguist-generated also collapses them in diffs, which keeps the 6.5 MB
# single-file bundle from drowning review.

# Built from docs/brand-guidelines.md; everything is inlined into one bundle.
public/assets/brand-design-system-guide.html linguist-generated=true

# Emitted by scripts/publish-deck.sh.
public/decks/**/index.html linguist-generated=true
